      "analysis_html": "<span class=\"math-tex math-inline\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"\\iint_{Z} x y z dxdy = 2 \\iint_{D} x y \\sqrt{1-x^{2}} \\, dx dy = 2 \\int_{0}^{1} x \\sqrt{1-x^{2}} \\, dx \\int_{0}^{1} y dy = \\frac{2}{3} \\times \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{1}{3}.\">\\iint_{Z} x y z dxdy = 2 \\iint_{D} x y \\sqrt{1-x^{2}} \\, dx dy = 2 \\int_{0}^{1} x \\sqrt{1-x^{2}} \\, dx \\int_{0}^{1} y dy = \\frac{2}{3} \\times \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{1}{3}.</span>"
