      "answer": "A",
      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{解答，根据轮换对称性，只要计算}\\iint\\limits_{\\Sigma}z^{2}dxdy\\,.\\,z-1=\\pm\\sqrt{R^{2}-(x-1)^{2}-(y-1)^{2}}\\\\&amp;\\quad\\sum_{x}\\text{在}xoy\\text{面上的投影为}\\left(x-1\\right)^{2}-(y-1)^{2}\\leq R^{2}\\text{利用极坐标标得}\\\\&amp;\\quad\\iint\\limits_{\\Sigma}z^{2}dxdy=\\iint\\limits_{D_{\\varphi}}\\left[1+\\sqrt{R^{2}-(x-1)^{2}-(y-1)^{2}}\\right]^{2}dxdy-\\iint\\limits_{D_{\\varphi}}\\left[1-\\sqrt{R^{2}-(x-1)^{2}-(y-1)^{2}}\\right]^{2}dxdy\\\\&amp;\\quad=4\\iint\\limits_{D_{\\varphi}}\\sqrt{R^{2}-(x-1)^{2}-(y-1)^{2}}dxdy=4\\int_{0}^{2\\pi}d\\varphi\\int_{0}^{R}\\sqrt{R^{2}-r^{2}}rdr=\\frac{8}{3}\\pi R^{3}.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{解答，根据轮换对称性，只要计算}\\iint\\limits_{\\Sigma}z^{2}dxdy\\,.\\,z-1=\\pm\\sqrt{R^{2}-(x-1)^{2}-(y-1)^{2}}\\\\&amp;\\quad\\sum_{x}\\text{在}xoy\\text{面上的投影为}\\left(x-1\\right)^{2}-(y-1)^{2}\\leq R^{2}\\text{利用极坐标标得}\\\\&amp;\\quad\\iint\\limits_{\\Sigma}z^{2}dxdy=\\iint\\limits_{D_{\\varphi}}\\left[1+\\sqrt{R^{2}-(x-1)^{2}-(y-1)^{2}}\\right]^{2}dxdy-\\iint\\limits_{D_{\\varphi}}\\left[1-\\sqrt{R^{2}-(x-1)^{2}-(y-1)^{2}}\\right]^{2}dxdy\\\\&amp;\\quad=4\\iint\\limits_{D_{\\varphi}}\\sqrt{R^{2}-(x-1)^{2}-(y-1)^{2}}dxdy=4\\int_{0}^{2\\pi}d\\varphi\\int_{0}^{R}\\sqrt{R^{2}-r^{2}}rdr=\\frac{8}{3}\\pi R^{3}.\\end{aligned}</div>"
